      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/match2115467date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">甘伯杯夺冠！巴萨2-1开罗国民 哈姆扎破旧主拉菲尼亚点射戈登失点</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2115467_1787168573_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2115467_1787168573_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2115467_1787168573_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>哈姆扎建功，拉菲尼亚点射+直塞策动进球，戈登失点，巴尔德献助攻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/match2075404date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲开门红！马竞2-0马拉加 李刚仁首秀世界波 阿尔瓦雷斯缺阵</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2075404_1787173009_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2075404_1787173009_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260820/zhanbao_image_2075404_1787173009_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>李刚仁替补上演首秀打入世界波，巴埃纳任意球直接破门，奥布拉克献神扑。此役阿尔瓦雷斯缺战。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a860269a0c50native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：米兰签22岁比利时边翼卫莫雷拉，转会费5000万+1600万浮动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200409273005_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200409273005_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200409273005_1280.jpg"> </div><p>AC米兰官方消息，球队签下22岁比利时边翼卫迭戈·莫雷拉。迭戈·莫雷拉将身披22号球衣，双方签约至2031年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a861573bad1anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这球帅炸！李刚仁替补精彩内切劲射破门，代表马竞西甲首秀建功</a></p><p>马竞vs马拉加第70分钟，李刚仁替补登场精彩内切破门，汉茨科助攻，李刚仁回归西甲后代表马竞西甲首秀即破门！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a863b47b017bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：热刺正在运作打包签萨维尼奥、马尔穆什，球队间谈判推进当中</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779708edf103.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic消息，热刺正在运作打包签下曼城前锋萨维尼奥和马尔穆什。目前双方尚未达成任何协议，但热刺与曼城的谈判正在推进中。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85db5ab4201native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">切尔西公布新赛季一线队号码：佩德罗改穿9号，亨德森拿到14号</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200041324879.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200041324879.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200041324879.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西俱乐部官宣了2026/27赛季一线队球员的号码，巴西前锋若奥·佩德罗在荣膺上赛季队内最佳球员后拿到了9号球衣。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85dfc592927native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">来真的！多名记者确认：无缘签小蜘蛛后，巴萨头号目标是劳塔罗</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68ddaeb682cb3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68ddaeb682cb3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68ddaeb682cb3.jpg"> </div><p>记者Gerard Romero、Alfredo Martínez和Víctor Navarro这三位记者，在短时间内同时确认，巴萨在无缘签下阿尔瓦雷斯后，目标确定转向国米前锋劳塔罗！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85dbacd8733native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">铁了心要来？记者：约克雷斯每天都在向巴萨自荐；劳塔罗获得认可</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/694728646cbee.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/694728646cbee.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/694728646cbee.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨跟队记者Víctor Navarro报道了球队的一系列转会动态。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85ff81425a5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">并非B计划？迪马：巴萨未为劳塔罗开任何报价 国米明确他是非卖品</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260514/6a04ffbc3d725.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260514/6a04ffbc3d725.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260514/6a04ffbc3d725.jpg"> </div><p>据记者迪马济奥消息，巴萨并未就劳塔罗向国米开出任何报价：该球员不在转会市场范畴内，被俱乐部认定为非卖品。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85e876a6159native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金球先生来了！甘伯杯赛前罗德里穿16号亮相，诺坎普全场欢呼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200133285835.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200133285835_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608200133285835_720.jpg"> </div><p>甘伯杯赛前，巴萨新援罗德里穿着16号球衣走出通道亮相，诺坎普满场球迷欢呼鼓掌，气氛非常热烈。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85ff905c6efnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">手续仍未完成！世体：未能正式亮相诺坎普，坎塞洛颇为不满</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260220/699830df66aed.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260220/699830df66aed.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260220/699830df66aed.jpg"> </div><p>据《世界体育报》报道，由于行政手续问题，坎塞洛未能在甘伯杯之前在诺坎普正式亮相，这让葡萄牙后卫颇为不满。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a85ce7518cd7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：B席知道罗德里曾可能来皇马时脸色微变，他们关系没有很好</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260809/6a78412751dc7_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260809/6a78412751dc7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260809/6a78412751dc7.jpg"> </div><p>记者基姆·多梅内克接受采访，谈到皇马中场贝尔纳多·席尔瓦与罗德里的关系。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a85f2692a1acnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅：在皇马不搞所谓铁腕纪律而是倡导常识，目前阵容毫无短板</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.79" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200214405678.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200214405678.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260820/202608200214405678.jpg"> </div><p>在新赛季西甲开启之际，皇马主帅穆里尼奥接受了俱乐部电视台的采访，他谈论了一些球迷和媒体非常关注的话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a8629b3d436enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">慢镜头：门德斯提出莱奥加钱换鲁本·迪亚斯，他与米兰谈了一下午</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg"> </div><p>据意媒慢镜头报道，知名经纪人门德斯提出一笔交换交易，让米兰以莱奥加现金交换曼城后卫鲁本·迪亚斯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a85c6069ddfdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">总薪水超1亿！官方：28岁曼城中场赖因德斯6100万欧加盟库迪西亚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608192316203315_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608192316203315_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608192316203315_1280.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，28岁曼城中场赖因德斯加盟沙特联球队胡拜尔库迪西亚。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-19/6a85c8a054037native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">7000万全收！因曼城过早出售赖因德斯，米兰立即拿满1400万欧浮动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260819/202608192316451946.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/upload